WEBVTT

00:00:59.972 --> 00:01:02.850
It turns out that most of the stuff
which fills our universe

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.228
is completely invisible to us.

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:08.314
In other words, visible matter,

00:01:08.356 --> 00:01:11.609
the kind that we
and the stars are made from,

00:01:11.609 --> 00:01:13.194
the kind that radiates light,

00:01:13.236 --> 00:01:14.904
is not what's normal.

00:01:15.238 --> 00:01:17.740
And we, the luminous matter,

00:01:17.782 --> 00:01:20.159
we are the cosmic weirdos.

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:24.372
So how do we know?

00:01:25.206 --> 00:01:28.209
Well, consider this invisible
nonbinary person,

00:01:28.251 --> 00:01:30.920
who's hiding in plain sight
inside of their suit.